// Machine-specific Niri outputs for the laptop profile.
// Installed once to ~/.config/niri/local.kdl; never overwritten by the installer.
// Fill in real output identifiers from `niri msg outputs`, e.g.:
//
// output "BOE 0x0B69 Unknown" {
//     scale 1
// }
//
// External monitors/docks: add one output block per confirmed identifier.
// Recheck after display, dock, or driver changes.
